{"id": "book015-s000007", "status": "judged", "book_no": 15, "source_sha256": "e555c0f5928dfdb2a5e612b2bcf0fa9cd636777e129ef357fd44df3051d12af4", "source": "天文学や数学などの\n数理科学的分野を対象とする暦算、\nそして、易学の一側面として、\n福を冀い禍を逃れることを目的とし、\n数のもつ神秘性に着目する占術からなり、\n広く東アジア全域に巨大な影響を与えてきた。", "language": "japanese", "content_type": "prose", "action": "translate", "modern_text": "术数学是以天文学、数学等数理科学领域为对象的历算，以及作为易学的一个侧面，以祈求福运、逃避灾祸为目的，关注数字所具有的神秘性的占术，它广泛地对整个东亚地区产生了巨大影响。", "term_notes": [], "writer_confidence": "high", "initial_judge_verdict": "accept", "repair_rounds": 0, "repair_models_used": [], "judge_verdict": "accept", "judge_confidence": "high", "issues": [], "uncertainty": [], "missing_locked_terms": [], "missing_protected_tokens": [], "source_candidate_similarity": 0.309392, "source_duplicated": false, "insufficient_modernization": false, "unsupported_expansions": [], "unapproved_parenthetical_notes": [], "unquoted_opaque_terms": [], "unsupported_opaque_definitions": [], "preserved_modern_source": false, "writer_model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B", "repair_model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B", "escalation_model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B", "judge_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2", "generated_at": "2026-09-23T04:41:57.319814+00:00", "judge_issues": [], "local_issues": [], "revalidated_at": "2026-09-23T05:17:48.382634+00:00"}
{"id": "book015-s000018", "status": "judged", "book_no": 15, "source_sha256": "522759f03c0e8f05ab8d03b82a67f3252045c3fd7ebac604bd7fac564beed9d7", "source": "術数学とは，中国の数術のこと。学術の目的は「数」のもつ形式的な関係や秘密の情報を明らかにするところにある。大きく暦算と占術にわけることができる。", "language": "japanese", "content_type": "prose", "action": "translate", "modern_text": "术数学是指中国数术。其学术目的在于揭示“数”所具有的形式关系或秘密信息。大致可分为历算与占术两类。", "term_notes": [], "writer_confidence": "high", "initial_judge_verdict": "accept", "repair_rounds": 0, "repair_models_used": [], "judge_verdict": "accept", "judge_confidence": "high", "issues": [], "uncertainty": [], "missing_locked_terms": [], "missing_protected_tokens": [], "source_candidate_similarity": 0.31405, "source_duplicated": false, "insufficient_modernization": false, "unsupported_expansions": [], "unapproved_parenthetical_notes": [], "unquoted_opaque_terms": [], "unsupported_opaque_definitions": [], "preserved_modern_source": false, "writer_model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B", "repair_model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B", "escalation_model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B", "judge_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2", "generated_at": "2026-09-23T04:41:57.320765+00:00", "judge_issues": [], "local_issues": [], "revalidated_at": "2026-09-23T05:17:48.382788+00:00"}
{"id": "book015-s000020", "status": "judged", "book_no": 15, "source_sha256": "6562c2aa3987fd8ab90b7fbf8743e706a2c1177648b6b0f7318fd39a2192490c", "source": "一方，占術は『四庫全書総目提要』の定義を借りれば，雑説を混えた易学の支流のこと。福を冀い禍を逃れることを目的とし，理論根拠を陰陽五行の生剋制化におくという。『四庫全書総目提要』など中国の書籍目録は総じて，易学の支流を術数学としながら，易学自体は経学として貴び，術数学に数えようとしないが，易学は実際のところ，卜筮の学であり，内容に即すれば，ただちに術数学占術の筆頭にあげねばならない。", "language": "japanese", "content_type": "prose", "action": "translate", "modern_text": "另一方面，若借用《四库全书总目提要》的定义，占术是混杂了杂说的易学支流。其目的是祈求福运、逃避灾祸，理论依据在于阴阳五行的生克制化。《四库全书总目提要》等中国书籍目录通常将易学的支流归为术数学，而将易学本身尊为经学，不将其算作术数学。但实际上，易学是卜筮之学，就其内容而言，理应列为术数学占术的首位。", "term_notes": [{"term": "五行", "note": "木、火、土、金、水五种分类及其关系体系"}], "writer_confidence": "high", "initial_judge_verdict": "accept", "repair_rounds": 0, "repair_models_used": [], "judge_verdict": "accept", "judge_confidence": "high", "issues": [], "uncertainty": [], "missing_locked_terms": [], "missing_protected_tokens": [], "source_candidate_similarity": 0.28655, "source_duplicated": false, "insufficient_modernization": false, "unsupported_expansions": [], "unapproved_parenthetical_notes": [], "unquoted_opaque_terms": [], "unsupported_opaque_definitions": [], "preserved_modern_source": false, "writer_model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B", "repair_model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B", "escalation_model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B", "judge_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2", "generated_at": "2026-09-23T04:41:57.321636+00:00", "judge_issues": [], "local_issues": [], "revalidated_at": "2026-09-23T05:17:48.383453+00:00"}
